  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/485dc27c36d56f0d78.gif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><img alt=\"תמונת החושן\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"205\" data-original-width=\"250\" src=\"/assets/images/content/485dc27c36d56f0d78.gif\" /></span></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תמונה טמונה</span></h2><div><h3><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"></div></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גלו את הטעות שנפלה בציור החושן בתמונת השער</span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מפה טמונה</span></h2><h3><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"></div><p style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">2 דמויות (מהפרשה) מוצגות במפה. גלו אותן</span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/5c6d50db1e00dfe9a8.gif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"511\" data-original-width=\"538\" height=\"304\" src=\"/assets/images/content/5c6d50db1e00dfe9a8.gif\" width=\"320\" /></span></a></div></h3></div><div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">סיפורי מִסְפָּרִים</span></h2><h3><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"></div><p style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">התאימו בין האובייקטים למספריהם - כמפורט בפרשה</span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מספרים:<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 6, 28, 4, 50, 10, 2, 5, 20</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אובייקטים:<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> קרסי זהב, בריחים, אורך היריעה, אורך הקרש, ימים, קרשים, רוחב היריעה, יָדֹת</span></span></p></h3></div><p></p><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></h2><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מתנה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span>🔲 </span><span style=\"background-color: white; white-space-collapse: collapse;\"><span>אֵלֵגַנְטִיּוּת</span></span><span><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 כיזב<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מהם נעשו דפנות המשכן (מהפרשה)\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 גוש מוצק (כגון בדם)\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שמחירו גבוה\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 צונן</span></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תמונה טמונה</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">במקום 'אשר' - נכתב 'אורי'</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מפה טמונה</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אהליאב, בצלאל</span></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">סיפורי מספרים</span></h3></span><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">6 - ימים (שֵׁשֶׁת יָמִים תֵּעָשֶׂה מְלָאכָה)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">28 - אורך היריעה (אֹרֶךְ הַיְרִיעָה הָאַחַת שְׁמֹנֶה וְעֶשְׂרִים בָּאַמָּה)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">4 - רוחב היריעה (וְרֹחַב אַרְבַּע בָּאַמָּה)<br /> </span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">50 - קרסי זהב (וַיַּעַשׂ חֲמִשִּׁים קַרְסֵי זָהָב)<br /> </span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">10 - אורך הקרש (עֶשֶׂר אַמֹּת אֹרֶךְ הַקָּרֶשׁ)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">2 - יָדֹת (שְׁתֵּי יָדֹת לַקֶּרֶשׁ הָאֶחָד)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">5 - בריחים (חֲמִשָּׁה בְרִיחִם)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">20 - קרשים (לִפְאַת צָפוֹן עָשָׂה עֶשְׂרִים קְרָשִׁים)</span></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">שי, שיק, שיקר, קרשים, קריש, יקר, קר</span></p></span></div></div></div>"
}
